            <div layer-view-2="" class="section-summary-block max-width-30">
              <p>What started as weekend classes in a borrowed dance hall has grown into a full-time studio with eight teachers and more than forty classes a week. Along the way, the thing that kept us going was never the growth — it was the people who kept coming back.</p>
